_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**The OCR result has no effect when "Strict OCR Gate Verification" is on.**

When `ocrFound` is `false`, the loop still continues at Line 360. The `requireOcrGate` setting is never read. At Line 416, the final log reports "Successfully executed and verified all" slides even when an OCR check failed. Stop the replication when the gate is on and the check fails.

<details>
<summary>🐛 Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
         setExecutionLog(
           (prev) => prev + ` | OCR ${ocrFound ? "✓" : "✗"} ${ocrDetail}`,
         );
+        if (requireOcrGate && !ocrFound) {
+          setIsPlayingReplication(false);
+          setExecutionLog((prev) => prev + " | ⛔ OCR gate failed — replication halted");
+          return;
+        }
```
